# 统一换行: 文本按仓库约定存取, Windows/Mac 协作不会整文件 diff
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 脚本保持 CRLF, 否则 .bat 在某些环境下会出问题
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 字体与图片按二进制处理, 不做换行转换, 也不参与文本 diff
*.ttf  binary
*.otf  binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.webp binary

# GitHub 语言统计: 不要让字体把仓库标成二进制仓库
*.ttf  linguist-vendored
*.otf  linguist-vendored
